<title>PHILIPPINES: Belle Corp up 2.60 pct at 7.90 pesos.</title>
<headline>Belle Corp up 2.60 pct at 7.90 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming firm Belle Corp jumped 2.60 percent to 7.90 pesos in intraday trading on Wednesday on good business prospects in the industry, analysts said.</p>
<p>Volume was 23.6 million shares valued at 183 million pesos.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a gaming stock. It should have a premium over the market,&quot; said Fritz Aclan of Dharmala Securities.</p>
<p>Belle's stock has run up in the past weeks, recently reaching a high of eight pesos.</p>
<p>The company recently forged an accord with Malaysia's Metroplex Bhd to build a casino and hotel.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
